<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Motor union joins half-day strike.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Motor union joins half-day strike.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean Hyundai Motor's union will join a half-day strike on Friday called by the outlawed Korean Confederation of Trade Unions, a union official said.</p>
<p>The strike will last from 1 p.m. (0400 GMT) to 5 p.m. (0800 GMT).</p>
</text>
